From: lfdevs <lfdevs@lfdevs.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 22:56:49 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] backends/anland: render only for KWin repaint requests

Negotiate idle rendering with the consumer before disabling buffer-driven
repaints. Preserve accumulated buffer damage and legacy consumer pacing.

Submit only rendered frames, drop failed frames without presentation
feedback, and wait for buffer availability before resuming rendering.
Recover import failures with bounded reconnect backoff and handle fence
response failures immediately.

Based-on-patch: https://github.com/lfdevs/anland-termux/issues/53#issuecomment-5967846798
Co-authored-by: paleahn <paleahn@gmail.com>
